# Prometheus-FRR Exporter Configuration
# This file configures the command-line arguments passed to the prometheus-frr-exporter binary.
# The exporter exposes FRRouting (FRR) metrics (BGP, OSPF, etc.) in Prometheus format.

# ARGS: Command-line arguments to pass to the prometheus-frr-exporter server.
# These arguments are passed directly to the binary via the ExecStart or similar systemd directive.
# Note: If running under systemd, shell escaping rules apply (e.g., double backslashes for regexes).
# Default is an empty string.
ARGS="{{ args | default('') | string | trim }}"